WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.259
"Where is my ball?" Tom cried.

2
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:12.164
"Maybe your ball rolled away," Mittens said.

3
00:00:12.165 --> 00:00:25.103
"Let's look for it."

4
00:00:25.104 --> 00:00:32.132
The three kittens walked down the lane.

5
00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:52.492
They walked to the farm.

6
00:00:52.493 --> 00:01:03.903
A pig snorted.

7
00:01:03.904 --> 00:01:07.725
A round yellow thing lay in the pigpen.

8
00:01:07.726 --> 00:01:12.121
Tom gasped. "Is that my ball?"

9
00:01:12.122 --> 00:01:14.883
Mittens looked into the pigpen.

10
00:01:14.884 --> 00:01:17.283
"I'm not sure," she said.

11
00:01:17.284 --> 00:01:20.104
"It might be your ball."

12
00:01:20.105 --> 00:01:24.658
"I'm going in there to get it!" Tom said.

13
00:01:24.659 --> 00:01:31.596
"We'll help!" Moppet and Mittens said.

14
00:01:31.597 --> 00:01:35.739
Tom climbed up the pigpen.

15
00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:40.844
His sisters followed.

16
00:01:40.845 --> 00:01:51.823
The kittens walked along the top of the pigpen.

17
00:01:51.824 --> 00:01:54.312
"Yuck," Mittens said.

18
00:01:54.313 --> 00:01:59.354
"The pigpen is very muddy!"

19
00:01:59.355 --> 00:02:01.879
Moppet looked into the pigpen.

20
00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:08.491
She sighed. "That's not your ball, Tom.

21
00:02:08.492 --> 00:02:13.361
It's a rotten pumpkin."

22
00:02:13.362 --> 00:02:16.087
Suddenly Tom's foot slipped.

23
00:02:16.088 --> 00:02:19.315
"Whoa!" Tom grabbed Mittens.

24
00:02:19.316 --> 00:02:21.306
Mittens started to fall.

25
00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:23.083
She grabbed Moppet.

26
00:02:23.084 --> 00:02:25.933
The three kittens fell into the pigpen.

27
00:02:25.934 --> 00:02:27.441
Splat!

28
00:02:27.442 --> 00:02:32.108
They landed in the mud!

